        "sid": "1JN 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo heé adoorí gaa haratlintii' adór Yesu tar Kristo, heewí kwa laqwaál nee Mungú. Heé baabuú na/aay gu slaá', na/aydá' baabá aa laqwaál gu slaa' sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorihe a tsaahhaán adór na/aá Mungú kir sla'aan, bar Mungú u sla'aan, nee dabeerós bara eeharaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma dabeerós bar iialooeemisaán, gár i laqaaqaan a atén Mungú u sla'aán. Slám bur sla'aán, dabeerós iialooeesaro ka gawdeeká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé taa laqwaál nee Mungú, yaamu gir baa/. Mungú bura haratlintiaán, haratlintaaoorén tí an gár yaamu gir baa/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé yaamu gir baá/ a heemá, aqo har kudá' aa haratlintí'iíke adór Yesu tar Garmoó Mungú.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu Kristo an kwí naa hardah ar ma'aay nee tseere. Naa hardihiiká ar ma'aay kilooín, ala nina hardáh ar ma'aay nee tseere. Qeeru an kudá' gu lamabu'uúm, asma Qeeru a looeema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma awa ngu lamabu'uumá' a tám [gawaá dooriwo, a Baabá, nee Axweesani, nee Qeeruú hhoohhoó', ala kuká' tám a wak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa tám i dayá' baraá yaamuwo, awa ngu lamabu'uumá']. Qeeru, nee ma'aay, nee tseere. Kuká' tamaawo lamabu'ungw'ín a wák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén lamabu'úngw muu u ya/aa/amaán, ala lamabu'úngw Mungú ku ak úr. Lamabu'úngw Mungú a kwí oo Garmaawós nguwa lamabu'ún. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé Garmoó Mungú gwa haratlintii', lamabu'uungwí gu kón baraawose. Heé Mungú gwa haratlintii'iiká, a Mungú guna lamusmo tleéhh, asma lamabu'uungwí Mungú Garmaawós nguwa lamabu'ún, gwa haratlintii'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamabu'uungw an kwí, Mungú slafíngw alhhe'eesay wásl nguna haniís. Slafiingwí naa haniís i baraá Garmaawós i dirii'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé Garmoó Mungú gwa haratlintii', slafingwí gu kón, oo Garmoó Mungú gwa haratlinti'iiká, slafingwí gu konká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí nguna kuungá' i gooiím, asma kawa xua' adór slafíngw alhhe'eesay wásl kur koonda', kuungaádá' umuú Garmoó Mungú ugwa haratlintie'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorihe a harahhifór koomaán dirose bar ugwa firiimaán ar adór inós i slai, ti axaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén bara xuaán adór tir axamiís, daqaní umuúqo gár kuwa firiimana, a xuaán adór kara slawaán.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hee bar hhiyaawós gwa ár, i tlakweemaá tlehhiit, ala a tlakweemaá gwa'arár kooma'aaká, ngu aleefirin, nee Mungú gu slafíngw i haniis. Ala firoorí a har dír mukdá' tlakweemaá gwa'ara gaa tleehhiiká. Tlakweemaá gwa'arár koomá' i dayá'. Aníng a kaahaaká ngu aleefirin as tlakweemaaká'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo gár ganaa'aaká a tlakweema, ala tlakweemaá gwa'arár kooma'aaká i dayá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
